OL,3,AFrom Bitcoin to Binance: Crypto terms
OL,4,Aand what they mean
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the rapidly rising and falling
OL,7,Fvalues of Bitcoin to high-profile
OL,8,Fheists like the hacking of Binance, the
OL,9,Fworld of cryptocurrencies is often in
OL,10,Fthe headlines.
OL,12,FThe world's biggest crypto exchange
OL,13,Fsaid hackers had gained access to
OL,14,F$6.3bn (#4.7bn) worth of digital
OL,15,Fassets, and while it has frozen about
OL,16,Fhalf, many remained in the hands of the
OL,17,Fthieves.
OL,19,FThese stories are full of specialist
OL,20,Flanguage that people outside the
OL,21,Findustry struggle to understand.
